rtl8821c-phy.bin contains the five MAC, AGC, AGC BTG type 2, baseband and
RF A arrays from rtw8821c_table.c in Linux v6.18. It starts with RTP1,
then a little-endian u32 pair count and (register, value) u32 pairs for
each array, in that order.

https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.18/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/rtw8821c_table.c
